bg-oklch(1 0 0 / 15%)/50 gap-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2 hidden md:flex border-primary text-primary hover:bg-primary hover:text-primary-foreground rounded-full px-6 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase h-10 bg-transparent transition-colors\">Checkout</button></div><div class=\"lg:hidden\"><div class=\" staggered-menu-wrapper fixed-wrapper\" style=\"--sm-accent:#D4AF37\" data-position=\"right\"><header class=\"staggered-menu-header relative z-50\"><button class=\"sm-toggle p-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2 z-50 relative flex items-center justify-center font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[10px] sm:text-xs transition-colors hover:text-primary\" style=\"color:#000\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><span class=\"sm:hidden\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"hidden sm:block\">MENU</span></button></header></div></div></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col w-full h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"bg-muted min-h-screen pb-24 font-sans\"><div class=\"bg-primary pt-32 pb-20 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-white/5 rounded-full blur-3xl -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/3\"></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 relative z-10 text-center\"><div class=\"\"><span class=\"text-secondary font-serif italic text-lg mb-4 block\">Our Story</span><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-6\">Designing for the <span class=\"text-secondary italic\">Modern Woman</span></h1><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-white/80 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto\">Marjaan Collection was born from a simple belief — that true elegance starts with holistic wellness and uncompromising comfort. What began as a passion for premium footwear has evolved into Pakistan&#x27;s trusted destination for both luxury shoes and pure, self-made organic body care.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 mt-16 max-w-3xl text-center\"><div class=\"\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-foreground mb-4\">Where It All Began</h2><p class=\"text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">We saw a gap in the market for a brand that could provide both international design standards in footwear and the purest natural ingredients in self-care. Today, our collection spans elegant stilettos, block heels, and strappy sandals, alongside our signature line of handmade organic shampoos, nourishing hair oils, body scrubs, and keratin treatments. Each product is crafted to help you look your best and feel completely nurtured.</p></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></div></main><footer class=\"bg-foreground text-secondary-foreground py-6 md:py-8\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 md:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-12 mb-6\"><div class=\"space-y-3 md:col-span-1\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-bold text-xl text-white tracking-wide\">Marjaan Collection</h3><p class=\"text-[#B5A5A0] text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-xs\">Your destination for premium quality footwear and holistic organic care in Pakistan. Discover stylish shoes and handmade self-care products for your everyday wellness.</p></div><div><h4 class=\"font-heading font-bold text-sm text-white mb-3 mt-2 md:mt-0\">Quick Links</h4><nav class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-xs text-[#B5A5A0]\"><a class=\"hover:text-secondary transition-colors w-fit\" href=\"/shop\">Shop Collection</a><a class=\"hover:text-secondary transition-colors w-fit\" href=\"/about\">About Us</a><a class=\"hover:text-secondary transition-colors w-fit\" href=\"/testimonia